      "kind": "user-confirmed",
      "description": "此前指定副标题使用50S字体，不是字号50。"
    },
    "spec-A5-1": {
      "kind": "spec-explicit",
      "pdf_pages": [
        108,
        109
      ],
      "description": "常见比例标识高度与至少1H的版心安全边距。"
    },
    "spec-A5-24": {
      "kind": "spec-explicit-and-diagram",
      "description": "识别口号的品牌柱对齐与最小高度；角落、二维码位置示意。"
    },
    "spec-joint": {
      "kind": "spec-explicit",
      "screenshots": [
        "截屏2026-11-11 15.50.46.png",
        "截屏2026-11-11 15.51.14.png"
      ],
      "description": "主要联合方为滴滴；0.5H间距、0.55H符号宽、合作方0.8-1.2H。"
    },
    "psd-pair": {
      "kind": "psd-measured",
      "file": "archive/evidence/regular/psd-measurements.json"
    },
    "proposal-v04": {
      "kind": "proposal",
      "description": "规范未给出的统一字号、字数计数口径、容量预留、组件尺寸及文字框起点。"
    },
    "denso-quiet-zone": {
      "kind": "technical-reference",
      "url": "https://www.qrcode.com/en/howto/code.html",
      "description": "二维码四周4模块静区。"
    },
    "user-copy-limits-2026-11-11": {
      "kind": "user-confirmed",
      "description": "S主标题最多10字、M最多12字、L最多14字；三档副标题最多18字。用户补充确认：8/10/12字换行阈值仅用于副标题。"
    },
    "user-semantic-title-2026-11-11": {
      "kind": "user-confirmed",
      "description": "加入：AI 推荐语义断行，用户可以调整。用于主标题。"
    }
  },
  "units": {
    "canvas": "caller-provided px or mm",
    "short_edge": "B=min(W,C)",
    "base_scale": "k=B/2126",
    "text_scale": "t=min(k,text_safe_width/1200)",
